<title>NEW ZEALAND: Hongkong Bank NZ cuts 1-5 yr fixed rates.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank NZ cuts 1-5 yr fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Bank said on Thursday it had cut its New Zealand one to five year fixed mortgage rates to 8.80 percent across the board, effective immediately.</p>
<p>This represented a 0.70 percentage point cut from the previous one year term, 0.40 percent for two years, 0.15 percent for three years and 0.40 percent for four and five years.</p>
<p>The floating rate remained unchanged at 10.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
